riquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2010世界盃時的勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（GettyImages）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143148769148276736726358.jpeg/3Tk_WMsgzATilE_oyq73ygQKjDDegobbJe_6oyXv-qM\"/><figcaption>2010世界盃時的勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（GettyImages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（GettyImages）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143148771987951616351849.jpeg/empjt0h3MlXcKLjskVzcm1g-C_b8Z18UxV9eDMVfXgw\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（GettyImages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149480695042048095376.jpeg/CvGWdxOU5dPfgOeY29g-TpOblJKLQw6wyi9VO8ovVTs\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149483572465664841769.jpeg/N5V2nNmaE3XkV3ttK-5pRvmZqubBNOYZHOPPVBzjz1Q\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149486336643072482910.jpeg/eWYe2qz9frIDmmQhaJK9R7h2QYXjhLmcDibTrg4m064\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149488790441984065273.jpeg/wrzKvzTpCtU06M66z7V1XMtqv1qGI7bYOrXzhDq184Q\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143149491063885824912680.jpeg/gzzy0x62xKXIb4ZoXjtnQyqs29qYy7Yp-vnGS_r5xks\"/><figcaption>勞莉莎里克爾梅Larissa Riquelme（Instagram@larissariquelme）</figc